1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,240
Sheprd can now keep your terminals in tmux, with no Herdr daemon.

2
00:00:06,241 --> 00:00:11,881
In Settings, under Tabs, pick tmux as the terminal backend.

3
00:00:11,964 --> 00:00:15,924
New tabs then open in their own tmux session.

4
00:00:16,758 --> 00:00:20,558
Quit Sheprd: the shell keeps running.

5
00:00:20,559 --> 00:00:24,839
Open it again, and the tab picks up right where it is.
